      "id": "MigrateFromGBA_Text_SafelyMigratedToPlatinum",
      "en_US": [
        "Six Pokémon safely migrated to\n",
        "the Pokémon Platinum Game Card."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Les six Pokémon ont été importés\n",
        "vers la carte de jeu Pokémon Platine."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MigrateFromGBA_Text_SafelyMigratedToPearl",
